n<h1>Image Cutout Service</h1>\n\n\n\n<form data-parsley-validate action='/image-cutout/' method='post' id='siap-form'>\n<input type='hidden' name='csrfmiddlewaretoken' value='06LU3UxfRvk6ySKdKOwqKsQU5mLRxQ4Hpmqy6ZHsGFLXKDx236E5zKMvo5HhtRW3' />\n<p>This service allows you to query reduced, WCS-registered SkyMapper images for those matching your region of interest. It will return image information and cutouts of the specified size around your search coordinates. You may additionally specify which filters and date ranges to return. The cutout service is also accessible through VO-aware clients like <a href=\"https://aladin.u-strasbg.fr/AladinDesktop/\" target=\"_blank\">Aladin</a> using the IVOA Simple Image Access Protocol (SIAP). See the <a href=\"/how-to-access/\" target=\"_blank\">How To Access</a> page for more information.</p>\n\n<p class='pwarning'>Note: By using SkyMapper data, you agree to observe the <a href='/policies/'>SkyMapper policies</a> published on this website.</p>\n\n<p><font color=\"#ff0000\"><b>Use of this service for systematic harvesting of large sky areas is not permitted. Users abusing the image cutout service will be blocked.</b></font></p>\n\n\n<div class='multiaccord'>\n\t<h3 class='multiaccord-head'><span class='multiaccord-head-arr'>&#9654; </span>Data Release</h3>\n\t<div class='multiaccord-box'>\n\t\t<table>\n\t\t\t<tr><td><label for=\"id_data_release\">Data release:</label></td>\n\t\t\t\t<td><select name=\"data_release\" data-parsley-required=\"true\" id=\"id_data_release\" data-parsley-required-message=\"This field is required.\">\n  <option value=\"DR4\">DR4</option>\n\n  <option value=\"DR2\">DR2</option>\n\n  <option value=\"DR1\">DR1.1</option>\n\n  <option value=\"EDR\">EDR</option>\n\n</select></td>\n\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t</table>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\t<h3 class='multiaccord-head'><span class='multiaccord-head-arr'>&#9654; </span>Coordinates</h3>\n\t<div class='multiaccord-box default-open' id='group-coords'>\n\t\t<p>Please input either a set of coordinates <strong>or</strong> a SIMBAD name.</p>\n\t\t<div class='third' id='group-coords-longlat'>\n\t\t\t<table>\n\t\t\t\t<tr><td><label for=\"id_coord_system\">Coordinate system:</label></td>\n\t\t\t\t\t<td><select name=\"coord_system\" data-parsley-required=\"true\" id=\"id_coord_system\" data-parsley-required-message=\"This field is required.\">\n  <option value=\"icrs\" selected>RA/Dec (ICRS)</option>\n\n  <option value=\"galactic\">Galactic</option>\n\n</select></td></tr>\n\t\t\t\t<tr><td><label for=\"id_coord\">Coordinates:</label></td>\n\t\t\t\t\t<td><input type=\"text\" name=\"coord\" value=\" \" data-parsley-pattern=\"^\\s*[\\-\\+]?[0-9]{1,2}h[0-5]?[0-9]m[0-5]?[0-9](\\.[0-9]*)?s[\\s,;]+[\\-\\+]?[0-9]{1,2}d[0-5]?[0-9]m[0-5]?[0-9](\\.[0-9]*)?s\\s*$|^\\s*[\\-\\+]?[0-9]{1,2}h[0-5]?[0-9]m[0-5]?[0-9](\\.[0-9]*)?s[\\s,;]+[\\-\\+]?[0-9]*\\.{0,1}[0-9]*\\s*$|^\\s*[\\-\\+]?[0-9]{1,2}h[0-5]?[0-9]m[0-5]?[0-9](\\.[0-9]*)?s[\\s,;]+[\\-\\+]?[0-9]{1,2}\\s[0-5]?[0-9]\\s[0-5]?[0-9](\\.[0-9]*)?\\s*$|^\\s*[\\-\\+]?[0-9]{1,2}h[0-5]?[0-9]m[0-5]?[0-9](\\.[0-9]*)?s[\\s,;]+[\\-\\+]?[0-9]{1,2}\\:[0-5]?[0-9]\\:[0-5]?[0-9](\\.[0-9]*)?\\s*$|^\\s*[\\-\\+]?[0-9]{1,3}d[0-5]?[0-9]m[0-5]?[0-9](\\.[0-9]*)?s[\\s,;]+[\\-\\+]?[0-9]{1,2}d[0-5]?[0-9]m[0-5]?[0-9](\\.[0-9]*)?s\\s*$|^\\s*[\\-\\+]?[0-9]{1,3}d[0-5]?[0-9]m[0-5]?[0-9](\\.[0-9]*)?s[\\s,;]+[\\-\\+]?[0-9]*\\.{0,1}[0-9]*\\s*$|^\\s*[\\-\\+]?[0-9]{1,3}d[0-5]?[0-9]m[0-5]?[0-9](\\.[0-9]*)?s[\\s,;]+[\\-\\+]?[0-9]{1,2}\\s[0-5]?[0-9]\\s[0-5]?[0-9](\\.[0-9]*)?\\s*$|^\\s*[\\-\\+]?[0-9]{1,3}d[0-5]?[0-9]m[0-5]?[0-9](\\.[0-9]*)?s[\\s,;]+[\\-\\+]?[0-9]{1,2}\\:[0-5]?[0-9]\\:[0-5]?[0-9](\\.[0-9]*)?\\s*$|^\\s*[\\-\\+]?[0-9]*\\.{0,1}[0-9]*[\\s,;]+[\\-\\+]?[0-9]{1,2}d[0-5]?[0-9]m[0-5]?[0-9](\\.[0-9]*)?s\\s*$|^\\s*[\\-\\+]?[0-9]*\\.{0,1}[0-9]*[\\s,;]+[\\-\\+]?[0-9]*\\.{0,1}[0-9]*\\s*$|^\\s*[\\-\\+]?[0-9]*\\.{0,1}[0-9]*[\\s,;]+[\\-\\+]?[0-9]{1,2}\\s[0-5]?[0-9]\\s[0-5]?[0-9](\\.[0-9]*)?\\s*$|^\\s*[\\-\\+]?[0-9]*\\.{0,1}[0-9]*[\\s,;]+[\\-\\+]?[0-9]{1,2}\\:[0-5]?[0-9]\\:[0-5]?[0-9](\\.[0-9]*)?\\s*$|^\\s*[\\-\\+]?[0-9]{1,2}\\s[0-5]?[0-9]\\s[0-5]?[0-9](\\.[0-9]*)?[\\s,;]+[\\-\\+]?[0-9]{1,2}d[0-5]?[0-9]m[0-5]?[0-9](\\.[0-9]*)?s\\s*$|^\\s*[\\-\\+]?[0-9]{1,2}\\s[0-5]?[0-9]\\s[0-5]?[0-9](\\.[0-9]*)?[\\s,;]+[\\-\\+]?[0-9]*\\.{0,1}[0-9]*\\s*$|^\\s*[\\-\\+]?[0-9]{1,2}\\s[0-5]?[0-9]\\s[0-5]?[0-9](\\.[0-9]*)?[\\s,;]+[\\-\\+]?[0-9]{1,2}\\s[0-5]?[0-9]\\s[0-5]?[0-9](\\.[0-9]*)?\\s*$|^\\s*[\\-\\+]?[0-9]{1,2}\\s[0-5]?[0-9]\\s[0-5]?[0-9](\\.[0-9]*)?[\\s,;]+[\\-\\+]?[0-9]{1,2}\\:[0-5]?[0-9]\\:[0-5]?[0-9](\\.[0-9]*)?\\s*$|^\\s*[\\-\\+]?[0-9]{1,2}\\:[0-5]?[0-9]\\:[0-5]?[0-9](\\.[0-9]*)?[\\s,;]+[\\-\\+]?[0-9]{1,2}d[0-5]?[0-9]m[0-5]?[0-9](\\.[0-9]*)?s\\s*$|^\\s*[\\-\\+]?[0-9]{1,2}\\:[0-5]?[0-9]\\:[0-5]?[0-9](\\.[0-9]*)?[\\s,;]+[\\-\\+]?[0-9]*\\.{0,1}[0-9]*\\s*$|^\\s*[\\-\\+]?[0-9]{1,2}\\:[0-5]?[0-9]\\:[0-5]?[0-9](\\.[0-9]*)?[\\s,;]+[\\-\\+]?[0-9]{1,2}\\s[0-5]?[0-9]\\s[0-5]?[0-9](\\.[0-9]*)?\\s*$|^\\s*[\\-\\+]?[0-9]{1,2}\\:[0-5]?[0-9]\\:[0-5]?[0-9](\\.[0-9]*)?[\\s,;]+[\\-\\+]?[0-9]{1,2}\\:[0-5]?[0-9]\\:[0-5]?[0-9](\\.[0-9]*)?\\s*$\" data-parsley-maxlength=\"500\" maxlength=\"500\" data-parsley-error-message=\"Unable to parse coordinate format(s)\" data-parsley-trigger=\"change focusout\" id=\"id_coord\" /></td></tr>\n\t\t\t\t<tr><td id='group-coords-longlat-errors' class='parsley-errors-list' colspan='2'></td></tr>\n\t\t\t\t<tr><td colspan='2' class='hint'>Separate longitude &amp; latitude with comma/space/semi-colon<br/>Valid coordinate types, e.g.:<br/>4h30m15.82s<br />4:30:15.82<br />4 30 15.82<br />60d30m15.82s<br />60.504<br />Colon/space separated values interpreted as HMS for longitude, DMS for latitude<br /></td></tr>\n\t\t\t</table>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"coord_long\" id=\"id_coord_long\" data-parsley-maxlength=\"25\" /><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"coord_lat\" id=\"id_coord_lat\" data-parsley-maxlength=\"25\" />\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class='third'>\n\t\t\t<table>\n\t\t\t\t<tr><th colspan='2'>OR</th></tr>\n\t\t\t\t<tr><td><label for=\"id_coord_target\">Target name:</label></td>\n\t\t\t\t\t<td><input type=\"text\" name=\"coord_target\" id=\"id_coord_target\" data-parsley-group=\"group-coords\" data-parsley-maxlength=\"200\" maxlength=\"200\" /></td></tr>\n\t\t\t\t<tr><td colspan='2' class='hint'>A SIMBAD-compatible target name</td></tr>\n\t\t\t</table>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class='clearboth'></div>\n\t\t<p id='group-coords-errors' class='parsley-errors-list'></p>\n\t</div>\n\n\t<h3 class='multiaccord-head'><span class='multiaccord-head-arr'>&#9654; </span>Size, Intersection &amp; Combine Options</h3>\n\t<div class='multiaccord-box default-open'>\n\t\t<div class='third'>\n\t\t\t<table>\n\t\t\t\t<tr><td><label for=\"id_size_long\">RA/&#8203;longitude size:</label><span class='hint'>*</span></td>\n\t\t\t\t\t<td><input type=\"number\" name=\"size_long\" value=\"60.0\" data-parsley-required=\"true\" data-parsley-min=\"10.0\" required step=\"any\" data-parsley-max=\"600.0\" data-parsley-type-message=\"Enter a number.\" data-parsley-required-message=\"This field is required.\" data-parsley-error-message=\"Image size must be between 10 and 600 arcsec\" data-parsley-trigger=\"change focusout\" id=\"id_size_long\" data-parsley-type=\"number\" /></td></tr>\n\t\t\t\t<tr><td><label for=\"id_size_lat\">Dec/&#8203;latitude size:</label></td>\n\t\t\t\t\t<td><input type=\"number\" name=\"size_lat\" step=\"any\" data-parsley-error-message=\"Image size must be between 10 and 600 arcsec\" data-parsley-type-message=\"Enter a number.\" id=\"id_size_lat\" data-parsley-max=\"600.0\" data-parsley-min=\"10.0\" data-parsley-trigger=\"change focusout\" data-parsley-type=\"number\" /></td></tr>\n\t\t\t\t<tr><td colspan='2' class='hint'>Arcseconds on sky (along image axes) - Dec/latitude size defaults to RA/longitude size if left blank</td></tr>\n\t\t\t</table>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class='third'>\n\t\t\t<table>\n\t\t\t\t<tr><td><label for=\"id_intersect\">Intersection type:</label><span class='hint'>*</span></td>\n\t\t\t\t\t<td><select name=\"intersect\" data-parsley-required=\"true\" id=\"id_intersect\" data-parsley-required-message=\"This field is required.\">\n  <option value=\"overlaps\">Overlaps</option>\n\n  <option value=\"covers\">Covers</option>\n\n  <option value=\"center\" selected>Center</option>\n\n</select></td></tr>\n\t\t\t\t<tr><td colspan='2' class='hint'>Intersection types:<br />Overlaps - cutout covers any part of the region of interest (ROI)<br />Covers - cutout includes the entire ROI<br />Center - cutout contains the center of the ROI (default)</td></tr>\n\t\t\t</table>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"third\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n\t\t\t<img class=\"siaptype\" id='overlaps' src=\"/static/sm_siap/img/siap_intersect_grey_ovr.svg\" />\n\t\t\t<img class=\"siaptype\" id=\"covers\" src=\"/static/sm_siap/img/siap_intersect_grey_cov.svg\" />\n\t\t\t<img class=\"siaptype\" id='center' src=\"/static/sm_siap/img/siap_intersect_grey_cen.svg\" /><br />\n\t\t\t<h3><span id=\"intersect-type-description\" style=\"text-transform: capitalize;\">Intersection types</span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"hint\"><br />Green border denotes currently selected type</span></h3>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<script type=\"text/javascript\">\n\t\t\t$( document ).ready( function () {\n\t\t\t\t$('.siaptype').css('border', 'none');\n\t\t\t\tvar selected = $('#id_intersect option:selected').val();\n\t\t\t\t$('.siaptype#'+selected).css('border', '2px solid #00693C');\n\t\t\t\t$('#id_intersect').change(function () {\n\t\t\t\t\t$('.siaptype').css('border', 'none');\n\t\t\t\t\tvar selected = $('#id_intersect option:selected').val();\n\t\t\t\t\t$('.siaptype#'+selected).css('border', '2px solid #00693C');\n\t\t\t\t});\n\t\t\t\t$('.siaptype').hover(function () {\n\t\t\t\t\t$( this ).css('background-color', 'lightgrey');\n\t\t\t\t\tconsole.log()\n\t\t\t\t\t$('#intersect-type-description').text($(this).attr('id') );\n\t\t\t\t\t$('#intersect-type-description').css('font-weight', 'bold');\n\t\t\t\t},\n\t\t\t\tfunction () {\n\t\t\t\t\t$( this ).css('background', 'none');\n\t\t\t\t\t$('#intersect-type-description').text('Intersection types');\n\t\t\t\t\t$('#intersect-type-description').css('font-weight', 'inherit');\n\t\t\t\t});\n\t\t\t\t$('.siaptype').click(function () {\n\t\t\t\t\t$('#id_intersect').val( $(this).attr('id'));\n\t\t\t\t\t$('#id_intersect').trigger('change');\n\t\t\t\t});\n\t\t\t});\n\t\t</script>\n\t\t<div class='clearboth'></div>\n\t</div>\n<div class='multiaccord'>\n\n\t\n\n\t<h3 class='multiaccord-head'><span class='multiaccord-head-arr'>&#9654; </span>Additional Search Criteria (Optional)</h3>\n\t<div class='multiaccord-box' style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">\n\t\t<div class='third'>\n\t\t\t<table>\n\t\t\t\t<tr><td><label>Band:</label></td>\n\t\t\t\t\t<td class='threecolumn'><ul id=\"id_band\">\n    <li><label for=\"id_band_0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"band\" value=\"u\" id=\"id_band_0\" data-parsley-maxlength=\"14\" />\n u</label>\n\n</li>\n    <li><label for=\"id_band_1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"band\" value=\"v\" id=\"id_band_1\" data-parsley-maxlength=\"14\" />\n v</label>\n\n</li>\n    <li><label for=\"id_band_2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"band\" value=\"g\" id=\"id_band_2\" data-parsley-maxlength=\"14\" />\n g</label>\n\n</li>\n    <li><label for=\"id_band_3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"band\" value=\"r\" id=\"id_band_3\" data-parsley-maxlength=\"14\" />\n r</label>\n\n</li>\n    <li><label for=\"id_band_4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"band\" value=\"i\" id=\"id_band_4\" data-parsley-maxlength=\"14\" />\n i</label>\n\n</li>\n    <li><label for=\"id_band_5\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"band\" value=\"z\" id=\"id_band_5\" data-parsley-maxlength=\"14\" />\n z</label>\n\n</li>\n</ul></td></tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t<tr><td colspan='2' class='hint'>Select none to return all available observer bands (i.e. no combined bands)</td></tr>\n\t\t\t\t<!--<tr><td>RGB filters:</td>-->\n\t\t\t\t\t<!--<td class=\"threecolumn\"> -->\n\t\t\t\t\t    \t\t\t\t    <!-- -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<!-- </td></tr>-->\n\t\t\t\t<!--<tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"hint\">Map filters to RGB channels</td> </tr>-->\n\t\t\t</table>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class='third'>\n\t\t\t<table>\n\t\t\t\t<tr><th colspan='2'>Start time</th></tr>\n\t\t\t\t<tr><td><label for=\"id_mjd_start\">MJD:</label></td>\n\t\t\t\t\t<td><input type=\"text\" name=\"mjd_start\" id=\"id_mjd_start\" data-parsley-trigger=\"change focusout\" data-parsley-error-message=\"Please input MJD times as a float only\" data-parsley-type-message=\"Enter a number.\" data-parsley-type=\"number\" /></td></tr>\n\t\t\t\t<tr><td><label for=\"id_ut_start\">UT:</label></td>\n\t\t\t\t\t<td><input type=\"text\" name=\"ut_start\" data-parsley-pattern=\"^[0-9]{4}/[01][0-9]/[0-3][0-9]\\s[0-2][0-9]:[0-5][0-9]$\" data-parsley-trigger=\"change focusout\" data-parsley-error-message=\"Time string must be of the format YYYY/MM/DD HH:MM\" id=\"id_ut_start\" /></td></tr>\n\t\t\t\t<tr><td colspan='2' class='hint'>UT time format: YYYY/MM/DD HH:SS</td></tr>\n\t\t\t\t<tr><td colspan='2' class='hint'>Specify only one start time</td></tr>\n\t\t\t</table>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class='third'>\n\t\t\t<table>\n\t\t\t\t<tr><th colspan='2'>End time</th></tr>\n\t\t\t\t<tr><td><label for=\"id_mjd_end\">MJD:</label></td>\n\t\t\t\t\t<td><input type=\"text\" name=\"mjd_end\" id=\"id_mjd_end\" data-parsley-trigger=\"change focusout\" data-parsley-error-message=\"Please input MJD times as a float only\" data-parsley-type-message=\"Enter a number.\" data-parsley-type=\"number\" /></td></tr>\n\t\t\t\t<tr><td><label for=\"id_ut_end\">UT:</label></td>\n\t\t\t\t\t<td><input type=\"text\" name=\"ut_end\" data-parsley-pattern=\"^[0-9]{4}/[01][0-9]/[0-3][0-9]\\s[0-2][0-9]:[0-5][0-9]$\" data-parsley-trigger=\"change focusout\" data-parsley-error-message=\"Time string must be of the format YYYY/MM/DD HH:MM\" id=\"id_ut_end\" /></td></tr>\n\t\t\t\t<tr><td colspan='2' class='hint'>Ut time format: YYYY/MM/DD HH:SS</td></tr>\n\t\t\t\t<tr><td colspan='2' class='hint'>Specify only one end time</td></tr>\n\t\t\t</table>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class='two-third'>\n\t\t\t<table>\n\t\t\t\t<tr><td><label for=\"id_verb\">Metadata options:</label></td>\n\t\t\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;<select name=\"verb\" data-parsley-required=\"true\" id=\"id_verb\" data-parsley-required-message=\"This field is required.\">\n  <option value=\"0\" selected>Basic information only - position, date, size, filter etc.</option>\n\n  <option value=\"1\">Minimum extra metadata - basic image quality information </option>\n\n  <option value=\"2\">Moderate extra metadata - WCS params: scale, CRPIX, CRVAL, CD</option>\n\n  <option value=\"3\">Maximum extra metadata - flags and filter wavelengths</option>\n\n</select></td></tr>\n\t\t\t</table>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"clearboth\"></div>\n\t</div>\n\n</div>\n<input class='btn-submit-highlight' type='submit' value='Get Image Cutouts' style=\"margin-top:15px\"/>\n</form>\n\n<!-- Custom form scripting -->\n<script>\n  $(function() {\n    $(\"#id_ut_start\").datetimepicker();\n    $(\"#id_ut_end\").datetimepicker();\n\n    // Custom Parsley validators\n    $('#siap-form').on('form:validate.parsley', function (e, formInstance) {\n    \t// Test if the focus is actually still inside the div, otherwise will fire\n    \t// every time we move around within group-coords-longlat\n\t\t// print('Event fired');\n\t\tif ( ($('#id_coord_long').val() == '') ? !($('#id_coord_lat').val() == '') : ($('#id_coord_lat')).val() == '' ) {\n\t\t\talert('Fired validation issue');\n\t\t\tformInstance.submitEvent.preventDefault();\n\t\t\t// alert('Error detected');\n\t\t\t$('#group-coords-longlat-errors').html('Please provide both longitude and latitude');\n\t\t} else {\n\t    \t$('#group-coords-longlat-errors').html('');\n\t    }\n    });\n  });\n\n</script>\n<p></p>\n\n\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"clearboth\"></div>\n\t\t<div id='footer'><p>\n\t\t\tThe use of all SkyMapper data is governed by the <a href='/policies/'>policies</a> outlined on this website. Please review them prior to downloading or publishing data.<br/>\n\t\t\tCopyright &copy; 2026 <a href='https://rsaa.anu.edu.au/'>Research School of Astronomy and Astrophysics</a>, <a href='https://www.anu.edu.au/'>The Australian National University</a>. Development funded by <a href='http://astronomyaustralia.org.au/'>Astronomy Australia Ltd.</a> as part of the <a href='http://www.asvo.org.au/'>All-Sky Virtual Observatory</a> and <a href='https://odc.org.au/'>Optical Data Centre</a>. Hosted by <a href='http://nci.org.au/'>National Computational Infrastructure</a>.<br />\n\t\t\tPowered by <a href='https://www.djangoproject.com' target='_blank'>Django</a> and <a href=\"https://www.cherrypy.org\" target=\"_blank\">CherryPy</a>.</p></div>\n\t</div>\n\n\n</body>\n\n</html>\n"
